'''Lifesaving Shovel''' is the sixth and final stage in [[The Gelatin Mines]]. [[Urs & Fenrir (Enemy)|Urs & Fenrir]] and [[Croconator]] debut here. Upon completion, players have a 30% chance to unlock [[Urs & Fenrir (Special Cat)|Urs & Fenrir]] (guaranteed if a Treasure Radar is used). This is a [[No Continues]] stage.

